  "accomplishments": [
    "Doctor now keeps unmanaged route paths and router in its finding, errors on an unbacked offline island, and reports an honest not_claimed when no route claims offline.",
    "The proof-lane evidence validator now rejects the fake all-zero commit and accepts unknown provenance only as three exact sentinels that can never become physical proof.",
    "verify_navigation_shell now writes the real crosswake version, the host template version and the host commit, with exact sentinels (\"unknown\" / \"git-unknown\") where a value cannot be known; the \"0.1.0\", \"161\" and all-zero placeholders are gone.",
    "The loopback harness now refuses `--evidence \"\"` and a bare trailing `--evidence` through `block()` after the EXIT trap, printing one JSON object (outcome blocked, rule LOOP-IOS-EVIDENCE) and exiting 2.",
    "The uncommitted Phase 187 tree passes every gate against the Phase 186 baselines, and all 24 guard-reverting mutations make their named tests fail; nothing was committed and HEAD is still bd294007.",
